WEBVTT

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:03.482
Fist of Flowing Water
Crushing Rock!

00:00:19.331 --> 00:00:21.667
Offense and defense
in perfect harmony.

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:25.379
The same fighting style,
but Bang's form is flawless.

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:28.007
The victor is already Clear.

00:00:53.908 --> 00:00:54.867
What the hell?

00:00:55.034 --> 00:00:58.579
The old SOB... It's not like him
to just wall on an opponent.

00:00:59.038 --> 00:01:02.625
Crap, I'm blacking out...

00:01:02.833 --> 00:01:05.044
I'm about...to aie!

00:01:12.593 --> 00:01:14.720
What is that preposterous style?

00:01:15.054 --> 00:01:16.097
Where'd you pick it up?

00:01:17.681 --> 00:01:19.558
It's as if you've become
an animal.

00:01:19.683 --> 00:01:20.643
I'm not done!

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:23.312
/can use him
and carve out an advantage!

00:01:23.437 --> 00:01:24.772
No you don't.

00:01:30.236 --> 00:01:32.780
I took care of the monsters.

00:01:33.656 --> 00:01:37.409
Bang, all that remains is Garou!

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:47.044
THE WIPING OF THE DISCIPLE'S BUTT

00:01:47.461 --> 00:01:52.091
But we had no idea Demon Cyborg
was so strong.

00:01:53.592 --> 00:01:55.803
And then, there's Silverfang...

00:01:56.345 --> 00:01:58.889
/can see no way
of pulling Garou out.

00:01:59.557 --> 00:02:04.395
But if I return empty-handed,
Orochi might devour me this time.

00:02:05.229 --> 00:02:08.649
I need Garou to somehow
get through this alive...

00:02:09.859 --> 00:02:11.610
But it looks hopeless.

00:02:12.361 --> 00:02:15.072
If that were you, Brother,

00:02:15.114 --> 00:02:17.825
would you still be standing
after so many wounds?

00:02:18.117 --> 00:02:22.329
If I were 60 years younger,
I could hang in there.

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:23.789
So I hope...

00:02:24.039 --> 00:02:26.750
Anyway, just a little more.
Now, Bang!

00:02:32.548 --> 00:02:34.133
Bang, you damn geezer...

00:02:34.383 --> 00:02:37.469
Coming at your former top disciple
when lm at my weakest...

00:02:38.137 --> 00:02:40.264
And worse,
the other old fart is Bomb,

00:02:40.389 --> 00:02:42.892
master of Fist of Whirling Wind
Slashing Steel!

00:02:43.767 --> 00:02:46.353
Arent they ashamed,
ganging up on me like this?

00:02:47.438 --> 00:02:50.024
Even if I put on a sob act
and beg for my life,

00:02:50.149 --> 00:02:52.234
Demon Cyborg would never let me go.

00:02:53.152 --> 00:02:58.657
My only way out of this
/s killing all three of them!

00:03:01.368 --> 00:03:02.369
But that's impossible.

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:08.000
Feel the pain Charanko felt, Garou!

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:12.588
Let's play heroes and monsters!

00:03:13.297 --> 00:03:15.382
Youre gonna play too,
arent you, Garou?

00:03:15.507 --> 00:03:16.717
Cimon, man!

00:03:17.176 --> 00:03:18.469
O-Okay.

00:03:19.178 --> 00:03:20.471
Dan-da-daan!

00:03:20.721 --> 00:03:22.306
Justice Man Is here!

00:03:23.724 --> 00:03:26.018
Justice Man Kick!

00:03:28.187 --> 00:03:29.146
Watch out!

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:30.105
Huh?

00:03:30.189 --> 00:03:31.190
That must have hurt.

00:03:33.651 --> 00:03:36.528
Okay, then you be the monster.

00:03:36.987 --> 00:03:37.321
What?

00:03:37.446 --> 00:03:39.240
You be the monster!

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:43.494
/s my life flashing before my eyes?

00:03:44.411 --> 00:03:46.622
Everything about this sucks.

00:03:47.581 --> 00:03:48.999
What was his name...

00:03:49.166 --> 00:03:51.210
You're the monster now, got it?

00:03:51.961 --> 00:03:53.504
That's right. Tat-chan...

00:03:54.964 --> 00:03:56.840
The most popular kid in class.

00:03:57.174 --> 00:03:58.926
What Is it? What happened?

00:03:59.134 --> 00:04:00.344
Garou was fighting!

00:04:01.095 --> 00:04:03.639
We were playing,
then out of nowhere, Garou got mad.

00:04:04.223 --> 00:04:06.976
It was just heroes, but then
Garou went ballistic on Tat-chan.

00:04:07.184 --> 00:04:09.227
What the heck?
What's wrong with him?

00:04:09.228 --> 00:04:11.105
Poor Tat-chan!

00:04:13.232 --> 00:04:15.317
Why did you get into that tight?

00:04:16.277 --> 00:04:17.236
Well, because...

00:04:17.653 --> 00:04:20.781
/s it true you became violent
over heroes and monsters?

00:04:21.365 --> 00:04:23.325
Tat-chan Is always...

00:04:23.534 --> 00:04:26.287
Cant you tell what's real
and what's pretend?!

00:04:26.495 --> 00:04:29.456
No, that's not it. !™m always
the monster and—

00:04:29.707 --> 00:04:31.333
Youre the one who lost his temper!

00:04:31.625 --> 00:04:33.252
How will you make up for it?!

00:04:33.961 --> 00:04:36.088
It's not like I didn't want
to be the monster...

00:04:37.172 --> 00:04:39.591
Did I hate that the hero
was always Tat-chan?

00:04:40.342 --> 00:04:42.261
No, not that either.

00:04:43.012 --> 00:04:44.930
It's because playing
heroes and monsters

00:04:45.097 --> 00:04:47.266
felt so overwhelmingly unjust.

00:04:48.267 --> 00:04:49.601
Heroes and monsters

00:04:49.977 --> 00:04:53.272
/s just a game that recreates
kids' TV shows.

00:04:53.981 --> 00:04:56.275
Everyone Is free to choose
What role they play.

00:04:56.734 --> 00:04:58.777
Tat-chan was the most
popular kid in class.

00:04:59.486 --> 00:05:03.657
But me, I was the loner kid,
always gloomy and without friends.

00:05:04.825 --> 00:05:07.453
Everyone knew who the hero
was going to be.

00:05:08.287 --> 00:05:10.497
I didn't stand a chance.

00:05:10.831 --> 00:05:13.042
Justice Man Cross Chop!

00:05:14.293 --> 00:05:15.878
Whyd you dodge?

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:17.379
Huh?

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:21.091
Guys, hold Garou for a SéCc.

00:05:21.258 --> 00:05:22.301
Okay!

00:05:23.594 --> 00:05:24.928
Naturally,

00:05:25.054 --> 00:05:27.306
there was no scenario where
the monster wins.

00:05:27.931 --> 00:05:29.307
I was always the loser.

00:05:29.308 --> 00:05:31.310
Justice Man Kick!

00:05:32.895 --> 00:05:35.314
Garou the Poop Monster
has been crushed!

00:05:36.774 --> 00:05:39.276
The popular kid at the center
of everything

00:05:39.568 --> 00:05:43.322
would always beat up the little guy
that no one liked...

00:05:44.698 --> 00:05:46.075
I can't take it anymore!

00:05:46.325 --> 00:05:48.327
Tat-chan, fight me!

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:50.746
Huh? Whatre you talking about?

00:05:50.996 --> 00:05:53.457
I don't want to be
the monster anymore!

00:05:53.791 --> 00:05:57.336
[fl win, promise me
youll leave me alone!

00:05:58.670 --> 00:06:01.340
Guys, hold Garou for a SéCc.

00:06:03.342 --> 00:06:05.302
That's cheating! Let go of me!

00:06:05.344 --> 00:06:07.346
I want to fight Tat-chan!

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:15.354
The other kids say you got violent
While you were playing.

00:06:15.771 --> 00:06:16.897
That's not what happened.

00:06:17.147 --> 00:06:19.024
Tat-chan Is just popular,

00:06:19.358 --> 00:06:21.068
SO everyone is making me
into the bad guy.

00:06:21.193 --> 00:06:23.445
No, you did something
you shouldn't have!

00:06:23.779 --> 00:06:25.364
You have to apologize!

00:06:27.366 --> 00:06:29.952
Screw justice.
And screw evil.

00:06:30.369 --> 00:06:33.831
/m gonna be killed because
that's what everyone else wants!

00:06:34.373 --> 00:06:36.458
It's not fair!
I cant stand it!

00:06:36.875 --> 00:06:38.377
It friggin' pisses me off!

00:06:38.961 --> 00:06:40.838
All I want is to make them
understand!

00:06:43.382 --> 00:06:45.884
I want to strike a blow
for the little guy!

00:06:46.427 --> 00:06:50.222
"Good" and "evil,"
I reject thern both!

00:06:51.056 --> 00:06:52.975
This is the end, Garou!

00:06:54.393 --> 00:06:56.395
Nothing's...

00:06:56.812 --> 00:06:59.648
...ended!

00:07:01.358 --> 00:07:01.817
What the—?!

00:07:07.322 --> 00:07:08.240
Garou...

00:07:09.366 --> 00:07:10.325
Bang! Above you!

00:07:24.381 --> 00:07:25.424
A monster?!

00:07:28.969 --> 00:07:29.845
Genos...!

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:32.264
Bang, he's a monster now!

00:07:33.432 --> 00:07:35.434
I will shoot them both down!

00:07:36.435 --> 00:07:37.644
Hear me now!

00:07:38.479 --> 00:07:40.564
I've got Garou with me!

00:07:40.939 --> 00:07:42.441
The others I leave to you...

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:44.651
Spiral Incineration Cannon!

00:07:45.444 --> 00:07:48.739
...Centichoro!

00:07:57.789 --> 00:07:59.166
What is this devilry?!

00:08:07.508 --> 00:08:09.968
Is that a living creature?!

00:08:10.511 --> 00:08:12.346
Look! The other heroes!

00:08:28.487 --> 00:08:33.116
It took the full brunt of
Genos' attack without a scratch...

00:08:33.242 --> 00:08:37.037
This adversary will no doubt
be fearsome indeed...

00:08:37.955 --> 00:08:40.499
CENTIPEDE MONSTER
CENTICHORO
THREAT LEVEL: DRAGON

00:08:44.503 --> 00:08:45.337
Tch...

00:08:45.462 --> 00:08:48.006
What's the big idea,
butting in like that?!

00:08:48.632 --> 00:08:51.593
Never mind.
Let Centichoro handle the rest.

00:08:52.511 --> 00:08:55.514
He's a living catastrophe,
destroying all in his path.

00:08:55.889 --> 00:08:58.684
I admire such indiscriminate
destructive power.

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:03.397
As usual, you didn't close out
your opponents, hero hunter.

00:09:03.855 --> 00:09:07.943
Once they're down, you have to keep
on them until they're truly done.

00:09:08.569 --> 00:09:11.738
Those heroes lying on the ground
were still alive.

00:09:13.532 --> 00:09:14.741
Well, not to worry...

00:09:15.367 --> 00:09:18.203
Nothing can survive Centichoro.

00:09:19.037 --> 00:09:20.789
You all can piss off!

00:09:21.498 --> 00:09:22.540
Those are my prey!

00:09:22.541 --> 00:09:24.542
Now, now. Keep still.

00:09:24.543 --> 00:09:26.545
Put me down, you shit!

00:09:26.878 --> 00:09:28.546
I won't let you do this!

00:09:28.547 --> 00:09:30.299
Why are you upset?

00:09:30.549 --> 00:09:33.218
It's your own fault
for not finishing them.

00:09:36.013 --> 00:09:38.807
The elimination of
two Class S heroes

00:09:38.932 --> 00:09:42.102
makes all this
very worthwhile for us.

00:09:43.729 --> 00:09:45.564
They're our greatest enemies,
after all.

00:09:46.648 --> 00:09:49.192
You experienced that
for yourself firsthand.

00:09:49.568 --> 00:09:51.737
Fights, you see,
are all about matchups.

00:09:52.487 --> 00:09:55.157
According to our strategist,
Gyoro-Gyoro,

00:09:55.449 --> 00:09:57.909
the only ones who could
resist Centichoro are

00:09:58.827 --> 00:10:04.333
the powerful psychic with abilities
beyond any other, Terrible Tornado,

00:10:04.583 --> 00:10:08.253
the recluse with an arsenal of
military technology, Metal Knight,

00:10:08.587 --> 00:10:11.757
the hero called
the strongest human, King,

00:10:12.674 --> 00:10:17.596
and the top-ranked hero who
nearly killed Centichoro, Blast.

00:10:18.263 --> 00:10:21.391
Centichoro is working
with the Monster Association

00:10:21.516 --> 00:10:23.852
specifically to get vengeance
against Blast.

00:10:24.603 --> 00:10:26.480
He's quite desperate to lure

00:10:26.605 --> 00:10:28.899
the number one hero
to the battlefield.

00:10:29.941 --> 00:10:32.944
From a matchup perspective,
those two Class S heroes

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:35.656
lack the means to escape
from their present predicament.

00:10:36.531 --> 00:10:39.076
Silverfang boasts
peerless technique,

00:10:39.326 --> 00:10:42.496
but it's only effective against
opponents of a certain size.

00:10:43.622 --> 00:10:46.625
Demon Cyborg's capabilities
are truly outstanding,

00:10:47.084 --> 00:10:50.212
but his strength cannot exceed
the firepower of his components.

00:10:51.213 --> 00:10:53.924
Those three face nothing
but certain slaughter.

00:10:59.638 --> 00:11:00.514
Here it comes!

00:11:00.639 --> 00:11:01.223
Genos!

00:11:01.348 --> 00:11:01.973
You're up!

00:11:02.099 --> 00:11:03.016
Understood!

00:11:11.274 --> 00:11:12.484
Whirling Wind...

00:11:16.488 --> 00:11:17.447
Flowing Water...

00:11:18.865 --> 00:11:20.534
Roaring Qi Rending Sky Fist!

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:38.552
What an amazing move...

00:11:39.386 --> 00:11:40.721
Against a carapace that hard...

00:11:43.473 --> 00:11:45.726
...it's the perfect counter!

00:11:46.518 --> 00:11:52.274
— Again! Again! Again!
— Again! Again! Again!

00:12:11.084 --> 00:12:12.669
We should've seen that coming.

00:12:12.919 --> 00:12:16.465
Yes, but we only had one shot
with that technique.

00:12:16.590 --> 00:12:18.258
Thank you, Genos.

00:12:18.383 --> 00:12:19.509
It was nothing.

00:12:19.968 --> 00:12:22.012
The attack we dealt it
was devastating.

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:24.723
The shock will travel through
its entire body.

00:12:24.890 --> 00:12:27.601
May you shatter into
a million pieces, damned demon!

00:12:30.228 --> 00:12:31.563
We're done here.

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:52.751
Really?

00:12:53.168 --> 00:12:54.920
The damn thing just molted!

00:12:55.253 --> 00:12:56.755
That's all we did?

00:12:56.880 --> 00:12:59.132
If we can't beat it,
what now?

00:12:59.758 --> 00:13:01.092
The city's over there.

00:13:01.218 --> 00:13:03.762
If it gets through,
it will be a massacre.

00:13:05.764 --> 00:13:06.764
Bang.

00:13:07.766 --> 00:13:09.309
I will take the thing on.

00:13:10.352 --> 00:13:12.771
I will hold the monster here
as long as I can.

00:13:13.063 --> 00:13:14.439
You two run for it.

00:13:15.482 --> 00:13:18.109
Genos, I can't go along with that.

00:13:18.235 --> 00:13:21.780
You mustn't be rash simply
because you know you cannot win.

00:13:22.197 --> 00:13:24.449
The future needs the young.

00:13:25.784 --> 00:13:26.785
Genos...

00:13:27.577 --> 00:13:29.788
Whatever you do, don't be rash.

00:13:32.791 --> 00:13:35.335
/s this truly the right path?

00:13:38.046 --> 00:13:39.798
I do not accept that!

00:13:50.851 --> 00:13:51.935
It's suicide!

00:13:52.269 --> 00:13:54.354
Your cannons won't work on it!

00:14:05.824 --> 00:14:09.411
Centichoro, Goketsu,
even Garou...

00:14:09.661 --> 00:14:11.204
... they are with
the Monster Association.

00:14:12.414 --> 00:14:14.624
There is no avoiding this tight!

00:14:20.213 --> 00:14:21.965
Dual Blade Rush!

00:14:25.468 --> 00:14:28.430
To fight one Is to fight them all!

00:14:34.561 --> 00:14:37.272
I will smash you apart!

00:14:39.190 --> 00:14:40.901
If battling thern Is being rash...

00:14:53.538 --> 00:14:54.497
Genos!

00:14:56.458 --> 00:14:58.335
...then/can no longer be...

00:14:59.878 --> 00:15:00.962
... worth anything in a tight!

00:15:09.387 --> 00:15:13.391
Jet Drive Arrow!

00:15:14.184 --> 00:15:15.185
Insignificant flea!

00:15:25.528 --> 00:15:26.321
What the—?!

00:15:26.446 --> 00:15:27.781
He went into its mouth!

00:15:30.909 --> 00:15:32.118
Die!

00:15:36.247 --> 00:15:37.958
This is...stomach acid!

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:40.919
I will leave you melted
into nothing!

00:15:42.003 --> 00:15:45.131
You are the one who will melt!

00:15:46.925 --> 00:15:51.137
Ultra Spiral Incineration Cannon!

00:16:00.438 --> 00:16:01.690
He did it!

00:16:41.104 --> 00:16:42.188
It happened again...

00:16:43.773 --> 00:16:46.985
I...could not win.

00:16:50.739 --> 00:16:52.198
I could not save them.

00:16:54.075 --> 00:16:55.869
Run, Big Brother!

00:16:57.996 --> 00:16:59.039
Pointless.

00:17:00.582 --> 00:17:01.541
What's the matter?

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:06.963
You've become awfully quiet,
little hero hunter.

00:17:08.006 --> 00:17:10.341
This isn't how things
were supposed to turn out.

00:17:11.009 --> 00:17:14.512
I wanted to defeat them
using my own strength,

00:17:15.013 --> 00:17:18.641
and by doing so, become
the very symbol of their fear...

00:17:19.559 --> 00:17:21.936
Why else even be the hero hunter?

00:17:22.395 --> 00:17:24.856
The symbol of their fear? You?!

00:17:26.733 --> 00:17:28.943
As you are now, your power
does not come close to

00:17:29.027 --> 00:17:31.905
Centichoro or the leaders of
the Monster Association.

00:17:34.449 --> 00:17:37.035
As lam now...
But just you wait.

00:17:44.042 --> 00:17:45.418
What Is it that I lack?

00:17:46.503 --> 00:17:49.339
There are still many more
like this monster...

00:17:50.715 --> 00:17:55.678
Am I to be merely a spectator
against monsters like that?

00:17:56.554 --> 00:17:58.056
Bang, we have a problem!

00:17:58.348 --> 00:18:00.100
It's driving us toward the city!

00:18:00.558 --> 00:18:02.268
Think of the civilian casualties!

00:18:07.482 --> 00:18:08.316
Bang.

00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:10.527
My brother...

00:18:18.535 --> 00:18:20.328
It's time I go all in.

00:18:27.877 --> 00:18:30.463
I will offer all the power
that remains to me in this life!

00:18:40.974 --> 00:18:41.933
Courage.

00:18:42.767 --> 00:18:45.228
Centichoro!

00:18:45.687 --> 00:18:47.105
Listen up, noxious pest!

00:18:47.230 --> 00:18:50.066
I brought Blast, the guy you want!

00:18:51.109 --> 00:18:52.610
That's King's voice!

00:18:52.861 --> 00:18:53.820
Did he say Blast?!

00:18:54.112 --> 00:18:55.613
Hey, look!

00:18:56.406 --> 00:18:58.116
It's turning toward the voice!

00:18:59.117 --> 00:19:00.243
Blast?

00:19:00.869 --> 00:19:01.828
You heard me.

00:19:02.412 --> 00:19:04.330
The guy who once beat you so badly,

00:19:05.123 --> 00:19:08.293
you ran away dribbling piss
everywhere!

00:19:08.918 --> 00:19:10.587
Blast, the hero, is here!

00:19:11.296 --> 00:19:13.673
If you want a rematch,
get over here!

00:19:14.674 --> 00:19:16.843
What's the problem? Scared?

00:19:17.552 --> 00:19:18.636
You coward!

00:19:19.345 --> 00:19:22.182
If you're gonna shit out
your guts for fear, do it at home.

00:19:23.141 --> 00:19:26.186
A lowly bug like you needs to
go back to your hidey-hole

00:19:26.311 --> 00:19:28.730
and suck on your mommy's milk!

00:19:30.023 --> 00:19:32.150
It appears King made it in time.

00:19:32.442 --> 00:19:33.318
Yes.

00:19:33.443 --> 00:19:37.405
He asked for information that
he could use to provoke Centichoro.

00:19:37.822 --> 00:19:40.992
He's planning to draw in Centichoro
for a head-to-head clash.

00:19:41.284 --> 00:19:42.452
Though it's classified,

00:19:43.411 --> 00:19:45.788
I told him about
the run-in with Blast.

00:19:46.664 --> 00:19:47.624
And his response?

00:19:48.041 --> 00:19:50.210
One word: "Understood."

00:19:52.712 --> 00:19:55.465
I also heard the roar
of the King Engine.

00:19:58.259 --> 00:19:59.469
For the final blow,

00:20:00.178 --> 00:20:03.848
lure him here and refrain from any
attack that might affect the city.

00:20:04.182 --> 00:20:05.183
That should do it.

00:20:11.189 --> 00:20:12.190
Uh, Saitama?

00:20:13.942 --> 00:20:16.444
Saitama!!

00:20:53.648 --> 00:20:54.732
That you, Genos?

00:20:57.151 --> 00:20:58.569
I guess he was here.

00:20:58.736 --> 00:21:00.446
Yeah...
Good thing we came.

00:21:02.323 --> 00:21:05.285
Saitama, it is just me?
You look relaxed or something...

00:21:06.786 --> 00:21:09.247
I'm kinda refreshed.

00:21:09.872 --> 00:21:13.251
I was stressed from you handing me
my butt at all those games.

00:21:13.418 --> 00:21:15.837
So he was still pissed off...

00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:18.089
Master Saitama!

00:21:18.589 --> 00:21:20.258
I need to ask you something...

00:21:20.758 --> 00:21:21.384
Yeah?

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:24.429
What do you think it is
that I lack?

00:21:24.971 --> 00:21:26.264
I mean, power, right?

00:21:28.558 --> 00:21:29.684
Thank you very much!

00:21:30.226 --> 00:21:32.895
Aw man! No!

00:21:33.104 --> 00:21:35.606
/f you use Saitama
as your baseline, youll...

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:38.318
Dont do it, Genos!

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:43.281
Master's battles show me
the true path...

00:21:43.906 --> 00:21:45.325
He is a symbol of strength.

00:21:45.783 --> 00:21:47.285
He 1s what I strive to be.

00:21:51.205 --> 00:21:52.915
I will get there too.

00:21:57.295 --> 00:21:57.795
Wanna head home?

00:22:12.477 --> 00:22:14.812
Through the once tranquil town

00:22:14.937 --> 00:22:17.190
A thunderous roar peals forth

00:22:17.315 --> 00:22:21.319
Watch out! Freak out! Monsters!

00:22:21.903 --> 00:22:24.155
Who ts going to take the lead

00:22:24.280 --> 00:22:26.324
When we destroy the evil ones?

00:22:26.449 --> 00:22:31.204
Destruction, contusion...
Loosen up!

00:22:31.329 --> 00:22:33.331
We know, We are...

00:22:33.414 --> 00:22:35.875
HEROES!

00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:37.543
Why were you

00:22:37.668 --> 00:22:39.962
born of evil?

00:22:40.088 --> 00:22:42.339
If you wish to know

00:22:42.340 --> 00:22:44.801
I shall tell!

00:22:44.926 --> 00:22:50.556
This night the punching fist
of glorious justice

00:22:50.681 --> 00:22:54.060
Will shatter your fate apart!

00:22:55.353 --> 00:22:59.982
That word exists for you
and you alone

00:23:00.108 --> 00:23:04.529
Raise your silent fist
to the sky!

00:23:04.654 --> 00:23:09.366
The apostle bears
the weight of solitude

00:23:09.367 --> 00:23:15.498
For a peace not filled
with hatred

00:23:15.623 --> 00:23:19.293
He must fight!

00:23:32.515 --> 00:23:35.393
Garou? Did you pass out?

00:23:35.476 --> 00:23:37.395
Rest well then.

00:23:41.899 --> 00:23:44.444
For soon, you will meet
Lord Orochi.
